From b749dfaead8b640456a6208a4a79ae6a62d07d6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fadi Kais <fadi@hsts.local>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 17:06:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Encode question and exam identifiers (requirements 33, 34,
 38, 39)

Question identifiers become a 3 digit question number within the course
followed by the 2 digit course number. Exam identifiers become a 2 digit
exam number followed by the course and subject numbers.

Course and subject numbers are supplied by the external school system
(requirement 19), so they get their own columns rather than being derived
from row ids. Both identifiers stay business keys alongside the existing
surrogate primary keys, leaving every foreign key untouched.
